{"4486220": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Touhou Brawl", "steam_appid": 4486220, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Solo or with friends — dungeons, brawls, and volleyball in one game!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dungeon-diving roguelike, a beat-'em-up PVP brawl, and reflex-driven superpower volleyball. Three completely different kinds of fun packed into one. Dig deep on your own or goof around with friends — every way to play is ready and waiting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4486220/extras/ab4db8148740b5d8f1e2ed1be39b1135.avif?t=1785460036\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4486220/extras_big/ab4db8148740b5d8f1e2ed1be39b1135.avif?t=1785460036 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>It all starts in one lobby. Pick the character you like and decide how you want to play today.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Playable Characters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cast of distinctive characters awaits you. Each has unique abilities and a playstyle of their own — pick your favorite and dive in.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reimu Hakurei</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Marisa Kirisame</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Youmu Konpaku</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sakuya Izayoi</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flandre Scarlet</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cirno</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hong Meiling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reisen Udongein Inaba</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eirin Yagokoro</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yuyuko Saigyouji</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Koakuma</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remilia Scarlet</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utsuho Reiuji</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Iku Nagae</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nitori Kawashiro</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mystia Lorelei</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hieda no Akyuu</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Co-op Roguelike Dungeon Crawler — solo or co-op</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dungeons that change every run, builds that shift every time. Die and start over — but come back stronger. Carve out your own route solo, or survive together with friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4486220/extras/6fa09a3504d1758c34512a7dc9c21ba7.avif?t=1785460036\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4486220/extras_big/6fa09a3504d1758c34512a7dc9c21ba7.avif?t=1785460036 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick your favorite character before you head into the dungeon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4486220/extras/dde290dd15eb463da045365835a83ce0.avif?t=1785460036\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4486220/extras_big/dde290dd15eb463da045365835a83ce0.avif?t=1785460036 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Choose from dozens of upgrades every run — the same character, a different build every time.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4486220/extras/767eade30338bbf515587e5553cee792.avif?t=1785460036\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4486220/extras_big/767eade30338bbf515587e5553cee792.avif?t=1785460036 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Buy items and refine your build at the shop between battles. Rinnosuke of Kourindou has been dispatched to help!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4486220/extras/57aca484cb3ba94e107003e925aa5251.avif?t=1785460036\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4486220/extras_big/57aca484cb3ba94e107003e925aa5251.avif?t=1785460036 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A powerful boss waits at the end of each stage. Read the patterns and strike at the openings.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4486220/extras/916d3d10454b1253ef616d4dcec63cf6.avif?t=1785460036\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4486220/extras_big/916d3d10454b1253ef616d4dcec63cf6.avif?t=1785460036 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Push hard enough and the boss goes groggy. That's your chance — pour on the firepower and turn the tables in an instant.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4486220/extras/f7d05e0b50e8443f9e7dd70e5608c346.poster.avif?t=1785460036\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4486220/extras/f7d05e0b50e8443f9e7dd70e5608c346.webm?t=1785460036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4486220/extras/f7d05e0b50e8443f9e7dd70e5608c346.mp4?t=1785460036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A hearty meal before diving in is a must! Grab some food at Mystia's Izakaya!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4486220/extras/e82378300dd9dfbd21ec8b2e686a29fa.avif?t=1785460036\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4486220/extras_big/e82378300dd9dfbd21ec8b2e686a29fa.avif?t=1785460036 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Gear up with solid equipment before you head into the dungeon! Nitori has all kinds of goods ready.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PVP Brawl — where real skill shows</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The skills you sharpened in the dungeon — now it's time to prove them to your friends. Battle to be the last one standing in fierce real-time brawls. Flashy skills and split-second calls decide who wins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4486220/extras/e7590352499875c3d4d85f5f6602d219.avif?t=1785460036\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4486220/extras_big/e7590352499875c3d4d85f5f6602d219.avif?t=1785460036 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A melee that fills the whole screen. Let your guard down for a second and it's over.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Superpower Volleyball — the hit you never saw coming</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's not all fighting. Take to a court where superpowers fly and settle it with pure reflexes. It looks simple, but once you start you can't stop — the perfect mode for a party.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4486220/extras/5a598e24adcbbdd9dc5362ab47417d99.avif?t=1785460036\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4486220/extras_big/5a598e24adcbbdd9dc5362ab47417d99.avif?t=1785460036 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A court where superpowers are flying. React now or lose the point.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Three completely different modes</strong> — Roguelike · PVP Brawl · Superpower Volleyball, all in one game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solo &amp; Co-op &amp; Versus</strong> — alone or in a crowd, however you feel that day</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless build variety</strong> — new strategies every run with augments and item combos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A party game that's more fun together</strong> — rowdy, chaotic fun</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump in right now, however you want to play.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Solo or with friends — dungeons, brawls, and volleyball in one game!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dungeon-diving roguelike, a beat-'em-up PVP brawl, and reflex-driven superpower volleyball. Three completely different kinds of fun packed into one. Dig deep on your own or goof around with friends — every way to play is ready and waiting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4486220/extras/ab4db8148740b5d8f1e2ed1be39b1135.avif?t=1785460036\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4486220/extras_big/ab4db8148740b5d8f1e2ed1be39b1135.avif?t=1785460036 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>It all starts in one lobby. Pick the character you like and decide how you want to play today.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Playable Characters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cast of distinctive characters awaits you. Each has unique abilities and a playstyle of their own — pick your favorite and dive in.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reimu Hakurei</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Marisa Kirisame</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Youmu Konpaku</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sakuya Izayoi</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flandre Scarlet</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cirno</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hong Meiling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reisen Udongein Inaba</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eirin Yagokoro</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yuyuko Saigyouji</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Koakuma</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remilia Scarlet</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utsuho Reiuji</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Iku Nagae</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nitori Kawashiro</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mystia Lorelei</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hieda no Akyuu</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Co-op Roguelike Dungeon Crawler — solo or co-op</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dungeons that change every run, builds that shift every time. Die and start over — but come back stronger. Carve out your own route solo, or survive together with friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4486220/extras/6fa09a3504d1758c34512a7dc9c21ba7.avif?t=1785460036\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4486220/extras_big/6fa09a3504d1758c34512a7dc9c21ba7.avif?t=1785460036 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick your favorite character before you head into the dungeon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asset