/4486220/extras_big/e7590352499875c3d4d85f5f6602d219.avif?t=1785460036 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A melee that fills the whole screen. Let your guard down for a second and it's over.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Superpower Volleyball — the hit you never saw coming</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's not all fighting. Take to a court where superpowers fly and settle it with pure reflexes. It looks simple, but once you start you can't stop — the perfect mode for a party.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4486220/extras/5a598e24adcbbdd9dc5362ab47417d99.avif?t=1785460036\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4486220/extras_big/5a598e24adcbbdd9dc5362ab47417d99.avif?t=1785460036 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A court where superpowers are flying. React now or lose the point.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Three completely different modes</strong> — Roguelike · PVP Brawl · Superpower Volleyball, all in one game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solo &amp; Co-op &amp; Versus</strong> — alone or in a crowd, however you feel that day</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless build variety</strong> — new strategies every run with augments and item combos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A party game that's more fun together</strong> — rowdy, chaotic fun</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump in right now, however you want to play.</p>", "short_description": "Solo or with friends — dungeons, brawls, and volleyball in one game! A roguelike dungeon crawler for solo or co-op, plus a skill-testing PVP brawl and reflex-driven superpower volley